<http://data.silknow.org/object/8346a26e-935e-3662-a224-e25b13168c18/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Terracotta grosgrain bodice and skirt. The bodice buttons onto a completely detachable plastron of pleated grey silk satin figured with a small pattern in terracotta velvet. Collar and cuffs of plain terracotta velvet. Bodice boned and lined in striped cotton. Skirt mounted on a terracotta alpaca wool foundation with channels for steel boning in back, also rows of tape ties, hem faced with black linen. Overskirt of box-pleated silk with draped overskirt."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/8346a26e-935e-3662-a224-e25b13168c18> .

